      "description": "Watch Union St. Gilloise vs Anderlecht highlights and goals from Jupiler Pro League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 31, 2026. The clash between Union St. Gilloise and Lommel United served as a captivating fixture in the Jupiler Pro League . Held on August 31, 2026, the match showcased the tactical and physical demands of modern football as both sides fought for dominance. First half momentum The match ignited early with high pressure from both teams. After a yellow card for Massire Sylla , the deadlock was broken in the 38th minute when Besfort Zeneli converted a pass from Guilherme Smith . The momentum remained with the home side as Mateo Biondic doubled the lead in the 45+1st minute, assisted by Zeneli . Despite a late first-half yellow card for Giulian Biancone , the team headed into the break with significant confidence. Tactical changes and the final push The second half saw both managers shuffle their packs to alter the game's flow. Following yellow cards for Marco Kana and Kevin Mac Allister , the game became increasingly fragmented. The turning point arrived in the 81st minute when Raul Florucz capitalized on an assist from Rob Schoofs to effectively seal the result. A flurry of late substitutions, including Nikki Havenaar and Relebohile Mofokeng , helped manage the final minutes until the referee finally signaled the end of proceedings."
